\n\n1. **IPv4 Address**: `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9])` matches octets 0-255 without leading zeros, repeated 4 times with dots\n\n2. **Date with Month Validation**:\n   - Months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12 → days 01-31\n   - Months 04,06,09,11 → days 01-30  \n   - Month 02 → days 01-29 (as specified)\n\n3. **Last Date Only**: The negative lookahead `(?!.*\\b\\d{4}-...)` ensures the captured date is not followed by another valid date on the same line\n\n4. **Word Boundaries**: `\\b` prevents matching dates/IPs embedded in longer strings (e.g., won't match \"user1134-12-1234\")\n\n5. **Line Processing**: The `^...$` anchors with MULTILINE flag ensure each line is independently checked for an IPv4 address, and only the last date is captured per line.","ttft_ms":90596,"type":"result","duration_ms":100438,"uuid":"bf09c4e7-59f5-48ae-85bc-064c50992c72","ttft_stream_ms":889,"time_to_request_ms":69,"queued_turn_count":0}
